Although all 17 submitted claims freshly produced `#Top`, the candidate lacks a universal whole-program claim and does not connect arbitrary comprehension execution to the intended filter result. Its proofs also execute a hard-coded program duplicate and remain successful after `solution.mpy` is materially changed.

The detailed seven-stage report is at [REVIEW.md](/audit-output/REVIEW.md), with reproducible scripts, mutations, and command logs under [evidence](/audit-output/evidence).
